# The Home Assistant app's image is built from the repository's root, but it
# needs only two directories of what Gradle has already built -- see
# homeassistant/wardrobapp/Dockerfile. Everything else stays out of the build
# context: Gradle's caches and every module's build output would otherwise be
# sent to the daemon on every build, for nothing.
*
!server/build/install/wardrobapp-server
!web/build/dist/wasmJs/productionExecutable
